        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> Strike</p><hr /><p><em>A corked flask holding layers of green, yellow, and amber liquid that never quite mix. The thin, watery chemicals shift and roil whenever the glass is jostled, with a pale vapor curling above them and a sharp, stinging smell leaking from the cork.</em></p><p>The volatile chemicals in this flask can be used offensively in a pinch.</p><p>The bomb deals 4d6 acid damage and 4 acid splash damage. You gain a +3 item bonus to attack rolls.</p><p><strong>Fleeting</strong> This item lasts only until the end of the turn it was created on, then becomes inert.</p>"
